      "role": "user",
      "content": "Those are good archetypes, but they feel a bit generic. I want them to feel more grounded and realistic for this specific city. Could you give them more specific backgrounds? Like, what are their ethnicities or cultural identities? I want to make sure the street-level characters feel like they actually belong to the specific neighborhoods they're coming from, to contrast with the protagonist's more upper-class, academic background.",
